<!--
    The Syra mark: three bars, transcribed from the canonical `SyraIcon`
    (`packages/sdk/src/live/assets/icons/syra-icon.tsx`) — same 500×500 viewBox,
    same three rects, so the widget carries the same mark as the app rather than
    a redrawn approximation of it.

    A vector rather than the app's monochrome PNG because `TitleBar` tints its
    start icon, and the adaptive monochrome asset carries the adaptive-icon safe
    zone, which would render the mark small and off-centre in a 48dp icon box.
-->
